TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Burası bir ada! Evet{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}},{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} okyanusun
ortasında bir ada{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}; ben de ada
olsam orada{{TAG:0003:0015:}} dururdum zaten.
Kayaya oyulmuş dev{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}{{TAG:0003:0017:}} kafalarıyla{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
ünlü. Bazıları toprağa{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
gömülüymüş. Moai deniyormuş ve
denize bakan{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} yaklaşık 887 tanesi
varmış! Belki beni{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}{{TAG:0003:0010:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
gözetliyorlardır? Sağ olun taş{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
kafalar{{TAG:0003:001F:}} ama{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} benim{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0002:}} YUVARLANMAM{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}
gerek! ...Şaka yaptım. Bu
kafalarla daha{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}} önce tanıştığımı{{TAG:0003:000B:}}
sanmıyorum; tanışsam{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
hatırlardım. Gerçi denize
düşünce unutkanlığım{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} tutuyor{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}...
Neyse.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Bir denizci olarak gidip
saygımı{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}} sunmalıyım. O adaya ne
pahasına{{TAG:0003:0000:}} olursa olsun
ulaşacağım! Hangi{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}} yerden söz
ettiğimi biliyor musun?

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}In this country I'm headed to,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} the
people do a traditional dance while
keeping their hips lowered!
{{TAG:0007:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:002A:}}It's called the Cossack dance!{{TAG:0007:0000:3C000000}}{{TAG:0007:0005:}}
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}It looks like a very uncomfortable
position, if you ask me{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Plus it's pretty tricky,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} but,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} hey,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
who's keeping track?{{TAG:0003:0001:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} It's a sight
to behold,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} so give it a try.
{{TAG:0007:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:002A:}}It looks kinda like this!{{TAG:0007:0000:3C000000}}{{TAG:0007:0005:}} {{TAG:0003:0009:}}Well, they do
it a lot better than I do{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}While it's on my mind,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} this country
is also famous for matryoshka dolls!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}If you pop open one of those dolls,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}another one is inside of it!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}If you pop that doll open,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}you'll find another doll!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}If you pop THAT doll open,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}you'll find ANOTHER doll!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}If you pop that doll open...

{{TAG:0007:0008:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}{{TAG:0007:000B:}}{{TAG:0000:0002:9600}}Just how long is this
supposed to go on for?!{{TAG:0000:0002:6400}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000A:}}Anyway,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} I just love the simplicity
of the endless dolls within dolls!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Now then,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} do you have any idea
where I'm trying to get to?

{{TAG:0003:0015:}}When you think of this country,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
you probably think of Vikings.{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
Big, strong guys with dragon boats!
{{TAG:0003:0021:}}I was a viking once,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} {{TAG:0003:0024:}}but I could
never get the hang of pillaging,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} so
I gave it up for standard sailing.
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Plus this country isn't just Vikings.{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
Nah, it's also mermaid princesses!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}They say that REAL mermaids
actually live there.{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} Real ones!{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0008:}}Not those fake, manatee ones!
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}Oh, lovely mermaid princess{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
I was on my way to your country
to meet you at last!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Wow!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} I can't wait a second longer!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Do you have an idea of where I was
most likely headed?

